        "Title": "Over Your Head",
        "Location": "LOCATION_HOKKAIDO",
        "PublicId": "110494459428",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository ca50b57a-9a88-457f-bb5f-dc2bf5a64ade).Image",
        "Description": "Hokkaido is now a prime Yakuza hotspot. \r\rYour first target, Tenma Kanou, quickly rose in the ranks of the local Yakuza in his hometown. Targeting youth and vulnerable minorities, he has rapidly become one of the most feared members of his group.\r\rYour second target, Tsuneto Ozaki, is his loyal right hand man. \r\rThey are both posing as resort security at the hotel. If the Yakuza believes there is foul play, the whole of Hokkaido will be at risk.\r\rGood Luck Agent 47.\r\rI will leave you to prepare.",
        "GameVersion": "8.25.0.0",
